@startuml
title Step 8-9 (For each resource order)

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

participant "Product Order\nCapture &\nValidation" as POCV <<blackbox>>
participant "Product Inventory" as ProductInventory <<blackbox>>
participant "Product Order\nOrchestration &\nManagement" as POOM <<blackbox>>
participant "Service Inventory" as SI #blue
participant "Service Order Management" as SOM #blue
participant "Event Mgt" as EventMgt #grey
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
participant "Resource Inventory" as ResourceInventory #blue

note over SOM, ROM : Subscribe to the SI events for specific Slice related RFS updates

group run through ResourceOrder orchestration

    ROM -> EventMgt : 1 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="inProgress")
    activate EventMgt
    EventMgt -> SOM : 2 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="inProgress")
    deactivate EventMgt

    note right of SOM : Resource order item\nspecific steps (follows below this section)

    ROM -> EventMgt : 3 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="completed")
    activate EventMgt
    EventMgt -> SOM : 4 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="completed")
    deactivate EventMgt

end

SOM -> SOM : 5 update CFSOrderItem (state="completed")

SOM -> SI : 6 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nPATCH /service\n(state="active")
activate SI
SI --> SOM : 7 **TMF638** 201 RFS

SOM -> SI : 8 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nPATCH /service\n(state="active")
SI --> SOM : 9 **TMF638** 201 CFS
deactivate SI

SOM -> EventMgt : 10 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="completed")
activate EventMgt
EventMgt --> POOM : 11 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="completed")
deactivate EventMgt

POOM -> POCV : 12 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management**\nPATCH /productOrder\n(product-specification-level order item\nstate="completed")
activate POCV
deactivate POCV

POOM -> ProductInventory : 13 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management**\nPATCH /product\n(product-specification-level order item\nstate="Active")
activate ProductInventory
deactivate ProductInventory

@enduml
